- Exposed `POST /checkout/prepare` so the REST layer can parse checkout payloads, delegate to the new service, and return a structured summary response (modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/api/rest/CheckoutResource.java:231).
- Added the `AddressValidatorAdapter` abstraction to cleanly swap address-validation providers behind `ShippingService` (modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/AddressValidatorAdapter.java:6).
- Synced both OpenAPI specs with the new checkout preparation contract so client SDKs reflect the endpoint (modules/core-platform/api/v1/openapi.yaml:2937, modules/core-platform/api/v1/openapi.json:3968).
- Implemented comprehensive Quarkus tests covering success, loyalty redemption, invalid addresses, empty carts, missing rates, and fallback flows (modules/core-platform/src/test/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/CheckoutServiceTest.java:44).
